§ `159. State Courts (Part 9): Second Schedule law and a District Court trial`

`tried in a District Court` MEANS `State Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
    `the offence is to be tried in a District Court` IS TRUE
    `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS FALSE

`tried elsewhere` MEANS `State Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
